Maintainer: Encore <noreply@github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libmpv2 | libmpv1, libsecret-1-0, libayatana-appindicator3-1, libstdc++6, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libegl1, libgles2
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/d-safro/encore-desktop
Description: Music from your Navidrome or Subsonic server
 Encore plays your own music library from a Navidrome (or any Subsonic /
 OpenSubsonic) server: podcasts, radio, lyrics, smart playlists and offline
 downloads, with the desktop's media controls and a tray icon. It works with
 Encore on your phone: the same account, the queue carries over, and each can
 control the other.
